                                            <span class="rk-card-main-heading"
                                                style="text-align: left; margin-bottom:10px"> Lodha Malabar South Mumbai</span>
                                            <p style="color:#333; font-size:16px"><h2><strong>Project Overview : Lodha Malabar Hills&nbsp;</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Lodha Malabar</strong> is an ultra-luxury residential development located in the prime neighborhood of South Mumbai, offering an exclusive lifestyle with unmatched sea views and world-class living standards. Designed for the elite, this landmark project redefines urban luxury with spacious 4 &amp; 5 BHK residences that seamlessly blend modern architecture with timeless elegance.</p><p>The <strong>Lodha Malabar price</strong> is structured to reflect its premium offering, ensuring that residents experience the finest living standards with flexible payment options. Prospective buyers can explore the official <strong>Lodha Malabar brochure</strong> to get a detailed understanding of layouts, configurations, and lifestyle features.</p><p>Residents will enjoy top-notch <strong>Lodha Malabar amenities</strong>, including a grand clubhouse, infinity-edge swimming pool, wellness and fitness zones, landscaped gardens, private lounges, dedicated concierge services, and high-level security, ensuring an exclusive and comfortable lifestyle.</p><p>In terms of <strong>Lodha Malabar connectivity</strong>, the project is strategically located in South Mumbai, with seamless access to Marine Drive, Nariman Point, Worli, and Bandra-Worli Sea Link. It is well-connected to leading business hubs, luxury retail, top educational institutions, and premium healthcare centers, making it an ideal choice for those seeking luxury with convenience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Lodha Malabar Hills Project Amenities</strong></p><ul><li>Swimming Pool</li><li>Indoor Games</li><li>Gym</li><li>Jogging Track</li><li>Kids Play area</li><li>Senior Citizen Zone</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Lodha Malabar Hills Project Connrctivity</strong></p><ul><li>Shree Babulnath Mandir - 3 min</li><li>Girgaon Chowpatty - 5 min</li><li>Hanging Garden - 9 min</li><li>Charni Road Railway Station - 7 min</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Lodha Malabar Hills Project Carpet area</strong></p><p>4 &amp; 5 BHK - 9500 sq.ft&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Lodha Malabar Hills Project Specification&nbsp;</strong></p><p>The positive reviews of Lodha Malabar Hills stem from its strategic location, spacious apartments, world-class amenities, and connectivity to important destinations.</p><p>Lodha Malabar Hills Mumbai stands out as a remarkable residential development that combines the tranquility of peaceful living with the ease of urban convenience.</p><p>&nbsp;Lodha Malabar Hills Address: Lodha Malabar, Krishanaraj Society, Sea Face, Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400006</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br><strong>Lodha Malabar Hills Prices </strong>&amp; its details can be found in the price section &amp; Lodha Vista <strong>Lodha Malabar Hills</strong> brochure can be downloaded from the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers &amp; Lodha Group review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Book your dream home today &amp; get the best offer, Enquiry us&nbsp;</strong></p></p>

