" height="450" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>	</div>
	

	</div>
	<p>Lodha Malabar is strategically located in the prestigious Malabar Hill locality of South Mumbai, along Walkeshwar Road, PIN 400006. Known as one of the most exclusive and sought-after residential areas in India, Malabar Hill offers residents a serene living experience amidst lush greenery and breathtaking views of the Arabian Sea. The project enjoys seamless connectivity to prominent landmarks such as Hanging Gardens, Babulnath Temple, Breach Candy, and Marine Drive. Essential lifestyle amenities including reputed schools, top-class hospitals, premium shopping destinations, and elite clubs are all within close reach, making it an ideal address for luxury living in South Mumbai.</p>
